{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "e1811c2e-79f4-8df4-8865-baf8601b6b6f",
  "created_at": "2026-01-19T16:12:53-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Theresa DeLuca",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T16:08:15-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T16:08:19-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi Kevin, it's Theresa DeLuca. I'm calling about a plow thing. The plow came through and left a big berm across our driveway."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T16:08:32-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, okay. Yeah, that happens. Let me grab a pen here. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T16:08:40-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "272 Memorial Boulevard. It's on the Easton's Beach side, you know where the bank used to be, the one that's the coffee place now? We're about two houses past that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T16:08:56-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 272 Memorial. And you said across the driveway, so it's blocking the whole entrance?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T16:09:05-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's a shared driveway, so it's blocking both units. Two cars are stuck in there. It's not even a real storm, we got a dusting this morning, that's it. But it's so cold the berm is basically frozen solid. It's like concrete."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T16:09:27-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, with this cold snap the stuff just turns to ice. Okay, so I'm writing, shared driveway, berm across the apron, frozen, light snow today. Is that about right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T16:09:43-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. And I've got tenants who have to get out for work tomorrow, so I'm the one getting the calls. I'm the landlord, so it all lands on me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T16:09:59-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, understood. Have you or the tenants tried to chip any of it out?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T16:10:07-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I mean, we shoveled the driveway itself first thing. Then the plow came after and buried it again. Kind of defeats the purpose."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T16:10:20-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's the classic. Okay, let me put it in as a request to have a crew come back and clear the end of the driveway."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T16:10:34-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So when's that going to happen? Is it today, tomorrow? I just need something to tell people."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T16:10:44-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'd say you're looking at sometime tomorrow, probably by midday. Today's a bit of a stretch since the crews are finishing up their routes and it's getting dark soon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T16:11:00-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Tomorrow midday. Okay. Because if they're leaving at seven in the morning, that doesn't help them."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T16:11:09-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, right. I'll note that there's early commuters. Can't promise they'll beat the clock, but I'll flag it so it's near the front of the list."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T16:11:23-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. I'd appreciate that. It's just annoying, every time they plow this stretch it's the same thing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T16:11:33-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, I hear you. Is there a good number in case the crew needs to reach someone?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T16:11:43-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, it's 401-555-0151."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T16:11:45-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 401-555-0151, Theresa DeLuca, 272 Memorial Boulevard. Shared driveway berm. Did I get that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T16:11:54-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, that's all of it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T16:11:57-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. You're in the system. And in the meantime, if you've got a bag of salt or sand, that can help a little with the ice at the edges, but the berm itself you'll want to leave to the crew."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T16:12:18-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, I've got some salt. I'll toss it down so nobody slips."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T16:12:25-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. Anything else I can help with today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T16:12:30-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's it. Well, I hope you have a good weekend, Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T16:12:37-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks, it's Monday, but I'll hold onto that for Friday. You stay warm."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T16:12:45-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, right, Monday. Okay, well, same to you. Thanks, bye."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T16:12:51-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bye now."
    }
  ],
